# The two entries below are the `generic-api-key` rule reading the keyword
# argument `owner_id=OWNER` on the line after `confirmation.manifest_token,`
# as a token value. The line is a repository lookup in a test; nothing on it
# is a secret. The commits are on the feature-014 branch already merged into
# PR #192 and cannot be rewritten.
